---
description: "Core rules for every task in this portfolio repository"
alwaysApply: true
---

Read and follow AGENTS.md in the repository root before doing anything.

The most important limits, repeated here:
- Never commit to main. Create a branch named ai/cursor/<short-task> and open a pull request.
- Never invent numbers or sources. Every figure must trace to a row in the project's sources.md.
- Never edit files in data/raw/.
- Never delete or rewrite devlog.md entries; only add new dated entries.
- Write TODO-VERIFY: next to anything not yet checked.
- Explain changes in plain language; the owner is a beginner and learning.
